m;\n  }\n  .section-title {\n    font-style: italic;\n    margin-top: 15px;\n    margin-bottom: 8px;\n  }\n  .citation {\n    color: blue;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"page-container\">\n    <div class=\"column\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"height: 310px;\">\n        [Chart: Performance of the broadband microstrip antenna, Frequency vs $|S_{11}|$]\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"caption\">\n        Fig. 8. Performance of the broadband microstrip antenna: initial design and optimized design with predicted and verified results.\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"height: 330px;\">\n        [Chart: Convergence rates, Number of simulations vs Avg. Fitness Function]\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"caption\">\n        Fig. 9. Convergence rates for the broadband microstrip AGD using different methods and different fitness functions.\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"table-container\">\n        <div class=\"table-title\">\n          TABLE II<br>\n          <span class=\"small-caps\">Statistics of Different Algorithm Results for<br>the Wideband Microstrip Antenna Design</span>\n        </div>\n        <table>\n          <thead>\n            <tr>\n              <th>Algorithm</th>\n              <th>Worst iter.</th>\n              <th>Best iter.</th>\n              <th>Mean iter.</th>\n              <th>Time*</th>\n            </tr>\n          </thead>\n          <tbody>\n            <tr>\n              <td>BPSO w/ imp. TF</td>\n              <td>&gt;1000</td>\n              <td>250</td>\n              <td>&gt; 680</td>\n              <td>&gt; 17.94 h</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>MLAO-AGD</td>\n              <td>342</td>\n              <td>107</td>\n              <td>254</td>\n              <td>9.62 h</td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n        <div class=\"table-note\">\n          * The time for the BPSO with an improved TF is estimated using the mean